# The HDR refresh image is built from the vendored compositor plugin. Keep it
# in the Docker context so local HDR/zero-copy changes cannot be silently
# replaced by the stale source already present in the base image.
!third_party
!third_party/gst-wayland-display
!third_party/gst-wayland-display/**
